              "message": "Fix: Properties Editor > Modifiers > Grease Pencil > Line Art > Geometry Processing - Align checkbox left #6174 (#7015)\n\n* Fix: Properties Editor > Modifiers > Grease Pencil > Line Art > Geometry Processing - Align checkbox left #6174\n\nCustom Camera was still drawn the Blender way (label, then checkbox and camera field), the only row in the subpanel with the checkbox after its label. It is now a left aligned checkbox like the other rows, and the camera field shows indented below it when enabled, the same pattern as Solidify > Fill Rim.\n\n* Fix: Line Art > Geometry Processing - Custom Camera in the modifier split layout #6174\n\nUse the same layout as the other Bforartists modifiers (Wave > Along Normals): checkbox left, the camera field on the same row when enabled or a triangle while off, and the checkbox decorator at the right edge like the rows below.",
